OL,3,AIran's president tells Trump it will
OL,4,Anever 'bend the knee'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPezeshkian also insisted any deal would
OL,7,Fhave to include an end to the US
OL,8,Fblockade stopping Iranian ships from
OL,9,Fusing a key Gulf waterway.
OL,11,F"It cannot be the case that everyone
OL,12,Fbenefits from the Strait of Hormuz
OL,13,Fwhile we are denied access," he said.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/38
